26 Shortage\",\"description\":\"Learn how Relay handles surpluses or shortages.\",\"href\":\"/references/api/api_core_concepts/surplus-and-shortage\"},{\"title\":\"Handling Quote Errors\",\"description\":\"Interpret and recover from quote errors in your integration\",\"href\":\"/references/api/api_core_concepts/handling-errors\"},{\"title\":\"Handling Rate Limits\",\"description\":\"Reduce your request volume and request an elevated limit when you reach Relay's per-key rate limits\",\"href\":\"/references/api/api_core_concepts/handling-rate-limits\"},{\"title\":\"Handling Execution Errors\",\"description\":\"Interpret fill and refund failure reasons returned after a request has been submitted\",\"href\":\"/references/api/api_core_concepts/execution-errors\"},{\"title\":\"Contract Compatibility\",\"description\":\"How to make your contract compatible with Relay\",\"href\":\"/references/api/api_core_concepts/contract-compatibility\"}]},{\"group\":\"Integration Guides\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Bridging Integration Guide\",\"description\":\"How to integrate the Relay API for bridging and onboarding\",\"href\":\"/references/api/api_guides/bridging-integration-guide\"},{\"title\":\"Call Execution Integration Guide\",\"description\":\"How to execute cross-chain calls using Relay\",\"href\":\"/references/api/api_guides/calling-integration-guide\"},{\"title\":\"Transaction Indexing\",\"description\":\"How to integrate Relay’s transaction indexing APIs\",\"href\":\"/references/api/api_guides/transaction-indexing\"},{\"title\":\"Base Builder Codes\",\"description\":\"Attribute onchain activity by appending builder codes to your Relay transactions\",\"href\":\"/references/api/api_guides/builder-codes\"},{\"title\":\"Smart Accounts in Relay\",\"description\":\"Sponsor gas, batch actions, and execute across chains with ERC-4337 and EIP-7702\",\"href\":\"/references/api/api_guides/smart-accounts\"},{\"group\":\"Chain Support Guides\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Testnet Support\",\"des